          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka nyithindho obedo ma del gi remo, Yesu bende olokere paka jo i del, aka nyaka i tho pere worey woko jwogi, manitie gi meni kwoŋ tho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋey wogonyi ji m'oyido jobedo ŋecin ro lworo tho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.41.8+ISA.41.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 41:8-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole gime neno kamaler ni ki jomalaika ama go konyo, to paka Ndiko waco, “Go konyo nyikway Abraham.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno, onwaŋo yenyere go wolokere paka wutmin i royo je, ŋey go wobedi jadwoŋ pa jocway ri Were i wi migam man gi wor kendo ma genere i tic pere ri Were, aka nyaka wogeŋ keme pa Were ri reco pa ji ŋey wocwaki jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka go onyo pama nyalo konyo joma jolimo karatem, rupiri go won bende olimo karatem aka ocandere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
